{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 2021,
      "hub_id": 2701,
      "guid": "com.acidphantasm.itemvaluation",
      "name": "Item Valuation",
      "slug": "item-valuation",
      "teaser": "Lightweight quick reference valuation tool. Items will be coloured based on configurable values (price, armour class, penetration, etc). Automatically works natively with Live Flea Prices.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2701.png",
      "downloads": 21271,
      "favourites_count": 35,
      "description": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1509-color-converter-api/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ColorConverterAPI</a> is <strong>required</strong> if you want to use custom colours.<br />\n<em>Without ColorConverterAPI, colours will default to hardcoded values.</em></p>\n<p>This mod allows you to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Adjust thresholds for ammo, weapons, armour, and items.</li>\n<li>Customise colours for ammo, weapons, armour, and items.</li>\n<li>Enable/disable colouring for specific item types.</li>\n<li>Enable/disable colouring for Flea Market banned items.</li>\n<li>Automatically works with <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1131/live-flea-prices\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Live Flea Prices</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>The background colours update after the next raid or client restart.<br />\nItem descriptions require a client restart to refresh.</em></p>\n<p><em>Special thanks to DRAKIA!</em></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xwf1IK7.png\" alt=\"xwf1IK7.png\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download Item Valuation</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Uninstallation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><hr />\n<ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-itemvaluation</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Alternatives</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2430/odts-item-info-spt-40\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ODT-ItemInfo</a></strong><br />\n<em>A solid mod, but I don’t particularly like how heavy or long-loading it is.</em></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1606-lootvalue/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">LootValue</a></strong><br />\n<em>Good mod, but not exactly what I needed.</em></p>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
